# T_SCRE: the assembly verbs of the item list's Record menu: Move moves
# item 5 to a location from the pick list, Install in installs it in an
# item whose ID is asked for, Take out takes it out again to the location
# its pick list opens on, the assembly's; Take out on an item that is
# not installed and Move on an installed part are refused with their
# messages, and Install in with digits naming no item searches them as
# text, finding none.
K DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN ALT-C M
S PICKMOVE
K HOME DOWN DOWN DOWN ENTER
S MOVED
K ALT-C I
S ASKPAR
T 20
K ENTER
S INTO
K ALT-C T
S PICKOUT
K ENTER
S OUT
K ALT-C T ENTER
S NOTINST
K ALT-C I
T 77777
K ENTER
S NOITEM
K ESC ESC UP ALT-C M HOME ENTER
S MOVEINST
K ESC
